{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49534","headline":"何满子 · 尹鹗","name":"何满子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云雨常陪胜会，笙歌惯逐闲游。\n锦里风光应占，玉鞭金勒骅骝。\n戴月潜穿深曲，和香醉脱轻裘。\n方喜正同鸳帐，又言将往皇州。\n每忆良宵公子伴，梦魂长挂红楼。\n欲表伤离情味，丁香结在心头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}